{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/1430747-actual-play-exaltwitch-academy","id":1430747,"title":"[Actual Play] ExalTwitch: Academy","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-01-02T07:42:11-08:00","id":1430747,"title":"[Actual Play] ExalTwitch: Academy","content":"RPGClinic announces a new Exalted 3rd Edition campaign: <i>ExalTwitch: Academy</i>!<br /> <br /> Set in The House of Bells, a military school for Exalted of the Realm, three Dragon-Bloods try to prove their worth to their fellow students, their Houses, and themselves.<br /> <br /> The team behind <i>ExalTwitch: Nexus</i>, <i>Changeling: The Streaming</i>, and <i>Full Party</i>, RPGClinic campaigns deliver professional storytelling, performances, and tech to bring RPGs to life for veterans and new players alike. There will be laughter, tears\u2026 and many double-entendres.<br /> <br /> Tune in every Sunday at 18:00 ET at <a href=\"http://twitch.tv/rpgclinic\" target=\"_blank\">twitch.tv/RPGClinic</a>.<br /> Our episodes will be archived every Tuesday at 09:00 ET to <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLsZP95-GZNa0ynoCIVyliNF5rypCHvh0M\" target=\"_blank\">this YouTube playlist</a> and in podcast form on <a href=\"https://anchor.fm/rpgclinic\" target=\"_blank\">anchor.fm</a>.<br /> We will host reruns on Saturdays at 11:00ET on <a href=\"http://twitch.tv/rpgclinic\" target=\"_blank\">twitch.tv/RPGClinic</a>, for folks who want the 'live' chat experience. <br /> <br /> Learn more about us on <a href=\"http://www.rpgclinic.com\" target=\"_blank\">our website</a>, our campaigns on <a href=\"https://rpgclinic.fandom.com/wiki/RPGClinic_Wiki\" target=\"_blank\">our wiki</a>, and our community on <a href=\"https://discord.com/invite/8mXus6b\" target=\"_blank\">Discord</a> or <a href=\"https://twitter.com/rpgclinic\" target=\"_blank\">Twitter</a>.<br /> <br /> ----<br /> <br /> While it likely won't come up during our Session Zero (January 3rd, 2021), thanks to some gorgeous overlay art and free time in lockdown we'll have an initiative track, PC health, and anima level displays. We have also built on the original concept from <i>Full Party</i> and now have rapid-response on-screen infoboxes with helpful rules and setting reminders.<br /> <br /> Our PCs will be starting at Essence 1:<br /> <a href=\"https://rpgclinic.fandom.com/wiki/Oresta\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Cathak Oresta</b></a>, Earth Aspect<br /> <a href=\"https://rpgclinic.fandom.com/wiki/Pyres\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Cathak Pyres</b></a>, Fire Aspect<br /> <a href=\"https://rpgclinic.fandom.com/wiki/Gale\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Ledaal Gale Whispered</b></a>, Air Aspect<br /> <br /> ----<br /> <br /> We'll be updating this thread as we go, and look forward to reconnecting with the Exalted community!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>-Kate, co-founding member of <a href=\"http://www.rpgclinic.com\" target=\"_blank\">RPGClinic</a> (known for <i>ExalTwitch</i> and <i>Changeling: The Streaming</i>)","edited":{"userid":26603,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26603-zen_r0b0","user":"Zen_r0b0","date":".  Edit to add rewatch time. 01-05-2021, 09:29 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26603-zen_r0b0","name":"Zen_r0b0","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26603_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-04T04:24:24-08:00","id":1430973,"title":"","content":"New content from the ExalTwitch team?! Hell yeah! That's good news! I will surely watch...although I will have to watch via YT, as my timezone is not compatible with your streaming-time...unfortunately.<br /> Have fun with your new story!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":""